# Written for this pack by BurN-30 (GPL-3.0). From the Uldaman chapter of
# 21-terres-ingrates-hinterlands.guide and its question in 20-strangleronce-marecage.guide (sources:
# Polestar's Forever data and Dungeons codex, Wowhead Forever's zone and quest pages read on
# 08/11/2026, Warcraft Tavern's Forever Uldaman quest guide read on 12/11/2026, room order from the
# original game's comments). Not played in game yet.
#
# Self-contained chapter for Polestar's own route: the Groupe Alliance module offers it at the end of
# forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades, once Kilgar's head (94894) or Delivering Closure (94893) is
# handed in in Stormwind (about level 44), when that guide sends the player to Thelsamar for the
# Badlands. It opens in a tab of its own: the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge for the dungeon's quests, the
# flight to Thelsamar, the Badlands and the dungeon, the rewards in Ironforge, and the flight back to
# Thelsamar, where Polestar's Badlands guide (40-50/02-badlands) starts. Polestar's guide keeps its
# place in its tab and comes back at the end.
#
# Compared with Polestar 0.4.2.2's own Uldaman page (Dungeons codex, Polestar_Codex, GPL-3.0, page
# "uldaman"; out of its route on purpose, data/dungeon-runs.json "notInRoute": no quest of the
# dungeon on a stop of the route in its window):
# - its route already does the quests of the dig outside (Agmond's Fate 704, Uldaman Reagent Run 17,
#   Solution to Doom 709 as a group question) and A Sign of Hope's first part (720, 30-40/06-badlands);
#   none of this chapter's quests is taken or handed in by the route;
# - same dungeon quests as this chapter: The Lost Dwarves and The Hidden Chamber (2398, 2240),
#   Reclaimed Treasures (1360), Power Stones (2418), A Sign of Hope's chain (721 to 726), The Platinum
#   Discs (2278, 2279, 2439), Power in Uldaman (1956, Mages), The Shattered Necklace (2198);
# - on its page but not here: the rest of Talvash's necklace chain (2199 to 2361) and The Lost
#   Tablets of Will (1139, after An Ambassador of Evil in Angor Fortress), which need a second run;
#   Indurium Ore (1192), open only after Rizzle's Schematics at the Mirage Raceway, later on the route.
# Prerequisites (Polestar's data): 721 after 720 (the route, 30-40/06), 722 to 726 one after the
# other, 2240 after 2398, 2279 after 2278, 2439 after 2279, 1956 after 1955 (Mages).
# Mythology of the Titans (1050) is offered on the Ironforge stop: it is for the Scarlet Monastery
# chapter (monastere-ecarlate.guide), offered at about 39 and again at Southshore right after this
# one for whoever answered "Later".
guide groupe-alliance/uldaman
title Dungeon · Uldaman (42-48)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 42-48
zone Badlands

step Stormwind: the Uldaman chapter
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Uldaman: a dwarf and titan dungeon at the north end of the Badlands, for a group of 5, levels 41 to 51 in the group finder: best at 43 or more. Its quests start in Ironforge: the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District, then the flight to Thelsamar and south into the Badlands. The rewards are handed in in Ironforge at the end; the flight back to Thelsamar then joins the route's Badlands guide.
  note Keep 6 free quest log slots. Everyone takes the quests at their own pace; meet at the dungeon's door for the run.
  goto 64.5,7.5 "Tram to Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge

step Ironforge: Hall of Explorers
  zone Ironforge
  tip Prospector Stormpike, Krom Stoutarm and Librarian Mae Paledust all stand in the Hall of Explorers. Mae Paledust's quest is for the Scarlet Monastery (Raleigh the Devout, Southshore): take it only if your group has not run it yet and still plans to.
  accept 2398                                 -- Prospector Stormpike
  accept 1360                                 -- Krom Stoutarm
  accept 1050 optional                        -- Librarian Mae Paledust: for the Scarlet Monastery

step Fly to Thelsamar
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Thelsamar"
  zone Loch Modan

step Badlands: Prospector Ryedol
  zone Badlands
  tip Ride south through the pass into the Badlands. Ryedol's errand left at the start of the route's Badlands visit, A Sign of Hope, now serves Uldaman: it sends you to Hammertoe Grez, just outside the dungeon.
  accept 721                                  -- Prospector Ryedol: for Hammertoe Grez, outside Uldaman

step Valley of Fangs: Rigglefuzz
  zone Badlands
  tip Rigglefuzz's Power Stones drop from the Shadowforge dwarves at Uldaman's door, not often: take it only if your group means to farm them a little.
  accept 2418 optional                        -- Rigglefuzz, Valley of Fangs

step Uldaman: Hammertoe Grez
  zone Badlands
  tip Hammertoe Grez waits just outside Uldaman, west of the cave. His amulet is on Magregan Deepshadow, a Shadowforge dwarf (elite 38) outside the dungeon portal, south of Hammertoe.
  turnin 721                                  -- Hammertoe Grez
  accept 722
  collect 4635 quest 722 @38.99,19.73         -- Hammertoe's Amulet: Magregan Deepshadow, elite 38
  turnin 722                                  -- Hammertoe Grez
  accept 723                                  -- For Prospector Ryedol, on the way out of the Badlands

step The digsite and the outer cave
  zone Badlands
  tip The Shadowforge dwarves of the digsite in front of the cave and of the outer cave drop both power stones, not often: no need to enter the instance for them. Krom's chest is in the outer cave, at the back of the left-hand hall, behind a pillar, with two guards.
  collect 8009 x8 quest 2418 optional     -- Dentrium Power Stone: Shadowforge dwarves
  collect 8052 x8 quest 2418 optional     -- An'Alleum Power Stone: Shadowforge dwarves
  collect 8027 quest 1360                 -- Krom Stoutarm's Treasure, from his chest
  goto 44.6,12.1 "Uldaman" r 25

step Baelog and the hidden chamber
  tip Baelog, Eric and Olaf wait in the first halls, at the top of a ramp. The chest beside Baelog holds the Gni'kiv Medallion, Revelosh drops the Shaft of Tsol: together they make the Staff of Prehistoria. Plant it in the Map Room, kill Ironaya (elite), then walk all the way into the chamber.
  note Share each quest with your group: click it in the quest log, then Share. A Shattered Necklace may drop on the way: its chain goes on with Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge.
  turnin 2398                             -- Baelog
  accept 2240
  complete 2240                           -- Explore the hidden chamber
  accept 2198 item 7666 optional          -- Shattered Necklace, a drop: for Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge

step Mages: Power in Uldaman
  only Mage
  when onquest 1956
  along until uld-archaedas
  tip The Obsidian Sentinel, one of the bosses on the way to Archaedas, drops the Obsidian Power Source for Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.
  collect 8053 quest 1956                 -- Obsidian Power Source: Obsidian Sentinel

step Archaedas and the Discs of Norgannon
  label uld-archaedas
  tip Archaedas, the last boss, wakes the stone guardians around his room during the fight. Behind him, the Discs of Norgannon: click them, talk to the spirit on the left, then click the Discs again for the miniature copy before you leave.
  accept 2278 object 131474 optional      -- The Discs of Norgannon
  turnin 2278 object 131474 optional
  accept 2279 object 131474 optional

step Rigglefuzz
  when onquest 2418
  zone Badlands
  tip Leave by the front, south to the Valley of Fangs.
  turnin 2418 optional                    -- Rigglefuzz

step Prospector Ryedol
  zone Badlands
  tip On the way back north to the pass into Loch Modan and the Thelsamar flight.
  turnin 723                                  -- Prospector Ryedol
  accept 724                                  -- For Historian Karnik in Ironforge

step Fly to Ironforge
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 33.9,50.8 "Thelsamar flight master"
  fly "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge

step Ironforge rewards
  zone Ironforge
  tip Prospector Stormpike, Krom Stoutarm and High Explorer Magellas are all in the Hall of Explorers; Talvash del Kissel in the Mystic Ward.
  turnin 2240                             -- Prospector Stormpike
  turnin 1360                             -- Krom Stoutarm
  turnin 2279 optional                    -- High Explorer Magellas
  turnin 2198 optional                    -- Talvash del Kissel: his follow-ups need another Uldaman run, not in this guide

step The Vault of Ironforge: the Platinum Discs reward
  when turnedin 2279
  zone Ironforge
  tip High Explorer Magellas hands a voucher for the Discs of Norgannon: Dinita Stonemantle pays it in the Vault of Ironforge.
  accept 2439                                 -- High Explorer Magellas
  turnin 2439 optional                        -- Dinita Stonemantle, in the Vault

step Hall of Explorers: Historian Karnik and Advisor Belgrum
  zone Ironforge
  tip Both stand in the Hall of Explorers. Karnik's last task, An Ambassador of Evil, leads to a second Uldaman run, not in this guide: do not take it. Last stop of the chapter: the route's own guide comes back; its Badlands guide starts at Thelsamar, a flight from here.
  turnin 724                                  -- Historian Karnik
  accept 725
  turnin 725                                  -- Advisor Belgrum
  accept 726
  turnin 726                                  -- Historian Karnik
